ed historical JSON paths no longer matched the unchanged files.json byte hashes. This corrective restores exact Git bytes from a8402fd552d6e2fcf0436d8f2872b7618cb92412 and verifies all six actual current payloads.\n\nChanges:\n- Restore the four original evidence blobs; retain the two reviewed TypeScript formatting corrections byte-for-byte.\n- Exclude only immutable current-candidate evidence from Biome formatting.\n- Add a fail-closed manifest verifier and 25 temporary-fixture tests for raw bytes, SHA-256, lengths, traversal, duplicates, missing files, malformed entries and symlinks.\n- Run verification and fixtures through npm pretest while preserving the exact historical 474-test expansion. The fixture spec reporter avoids duplicate TAP summaries in independent evidence verification.\n- Keep the CI job identity; explicitly run manifest verification, offline integration and existing halt tests.\n- Remove the redundant escaped archive; replace integrity metadata and correct the documented path-to-current-byte contract. No historical test result regenerated or relabeled.\n\nExact identities:\n- Starting branch: fix/multi-format-evidence-20260905\n- Starting HEAD: 9c0f63b1ab0e8c58796f63a1e4f86a9cae12d690\n- Starting tree: 75f5c4b4b5372db0cdf3eb519f910daada7bf61d\n- Result branch: fix/multi-evidence-byte-identity-20260905\n- Final HEAD: 4ead28400903ad6c62616835aa9459f67c6d8cd9\n- Final tree: 3a10f7645b30a33f27ecde824c16e0e36cacae6c\n- Diff: 12 files, +481 / -98. Changed paths are the PR Files changed list.\n- Patch SHA-256: 28d3bbd3f36af959377dee5902b0d5e277fe7ca958b4153de82339aa2dacf92c (57,586 bytes).\n- Unchanged lockfile SHA-256: a20cb9ac4dffb6cd9f19b594c6e9755dff5067a29bc0391a6ba99a80b5741b51.\n\nFinal exact-HEAD validation:\n- Pinned Node v22.23.2 / npm 10.9.8.\n- CI run 33967073453 / job 101308992804: GitHub conclusion success.\n- npm ci, typecheck, lint, format:check, npm test, test:offline-integration, test:phase2e, build, scan:secrets, dry-run, verify:candidate-evidence, Phase2D generation and independent verification: CI exit 0.\n- Tests: manifest fixtures 25, historical regression 474, offline integration 13, halt/reload 79; each has zero fail/cancelled/skip/todo. Focused corrective 15 and evidence verifier 46 are subsets of the historical 474.\n- Local final-HEAD npm test / test:phase2e / dry-run / Phase2D generation / independent verification exit 1: environment denies tsx UNIX-socket listen (EPERM); generation stops, so no local manifest exists. All other requested local commands exit 0, including fixtures25, integration13, clean install, static checks, build, scan, manifest, committed git diff --check and clean-tree check. Those failed local logs are preserved; CI results do not relabel them.\n\nEvidence:\n- CI artifact 9969805255: multi-venue-phase2d-c4-v2-4ead28400903ad6c62616835aa9459f67c6d8cd9.\n- Artifact ZIP SHA-256: f3642d425b6c1aa41b485be45f0f3f60c7b8567969924444e89cc951da73f6ff (download recomputed and matched).\n- manifest.json SHA-256: 115631cbd8f9c11dc92b9be1b7bff8f0a870f4e7f4739976620ea8d264f0f1f1.\n- verifier.json SHA-256: 722607d2f3d3ebfd900e1e3dd9611c9f747a74a2d3ff66e39fa242d08476141e.\n- The artifact binds both source HEAD and tested checkout to final HEAD/tree. integrityOk=true, independentReview=NOT_PERFORMED, gateStatus=NOT_EMITTED. Captured command log hashes were independently checked after download.\n\nRemaining blocker:\nLegacy trusted run 33967075000 / job 101308973075 still fails with exit 1 because the exact stacked base lacks scripts/governance/phase2d-trusted-gate.mjs. Enforcement skips and final aggregation fails. Governance PR #11 remains separate; this PR does not edit that gate or repository settings. Inaccessible legacy branch protection is not certified absent and needs repository-owner verification before separately authorized integration.\n\nAll frozen Phase2D/runtime/governance refs and PR #10 starting ref were rechecked unchanged. No runtime, risk, adapter, package-lock, dependency, frozen-binding or governance-workflow bytes changed. No merge, force-push, rebase, deployment, repository setting change, credential access, exchange write, testnet/mainnet action, or new trading/runtime phase occurred. No Classic code, fixtures or evidence were imported. PR #10 was not rewritten; PR #11 was not modified or combined. This PR remains Draft. No acceptance is asserted.","created_at":"2026-09-05T12:45:52Z","updated_at":"2026-09-07T16:55:32Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pulls/12/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pulls/12/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/issues/12/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/statuses/4ead28400903ad6c62616835aa9459f67c6d8cd9","head":{"label":"danny0971haha:fix/multi-evidence-byte-identity-20260905","ref":"fix/multi-evidence-byte-identity-20260905","sha":"4ead28400903ad6c62616835aa9459f67c6d8cd9","user":{"login":"danny0971haha","id":202909309,"node_id":"U_kgDODBgmfQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/202909309?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha","html_url":"https://github.com/danny0971haha","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/subscriptions","organizations_ur