s/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pulls/12/commits"},"statuses":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/statuses/4ead28400903ad6c62616835aa9459f67c6d8cd9"}},"author_association":"OWNER","auto_merge":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pulls/11","id":4450503286,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUAdvbc8AAAABCUVKdg","html_url":"https://github.com/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pull/11","diff_url":"https://github.com/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pull/11.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pull/11.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/issues/11","number":11,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"fix(governance): restrict Phase 2D trusted trigger to supported main base","user":{"login":"danny0971haha","id":202909309,"node_id":"U_kgDODBgmfQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/202909309?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha","html_url":"https://github.com/danny0971haha","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Problem\nThe trusted workflow checks out an arbitrary PR base that may not contain its classifier. The tooling PR fails MODULE_NOT_FOUND. The classifier documents main-target PRs, and active ruleset 21580900 applies its required context only to main.\n\n## Proposed correction\nAdd exactly one workflow line: branches: [main] under pull_request_target. Preserve all existing jobs, permissions, event types, trusted base checkout, Action pins, classifier/integrity code, candidate bindings and failure semantics. No successful context is fabricated for other bases. Repository rules/settings are not changed.\n\n## Identity\nBASE_SHA=22665d7fa9274dfc05de043c8e9663e24e75087e\nBASE_TREE=6981c1124524895273fb09b53d769ca9dbb722bc\nRESULT_SHA=de2f5c0fd055e418d0b6d806f994b52baa743544\nRESULT_TREE=1b443a620670216968b95cc43de96397550c24f2\nBRANCH=fix/multi-trusted-base-scope-20260905\nCHANGED_PATHS=.github/workflows/trusted-phase2d-freeze.yml; .github/trusted/phase2d-corrective4-baseline.json; docs/TRUSTED_BASE_SCOPE_CORRECTIVE_20260905.md\n\nSeparate governance corrective, not the format or agent-instruction checkpoint. Created through GitHub Git Data API from the exact main tree; no full local main checkout is claimed. No frozen or existing governance branch advanced.\n\n## Validation and limitations\nYAML parsed locally with PyYAML. Jobs/permissions/concurrency/event types compare equal; only the target-base filter is added. Existing classifier and live ruleset read independently. Local Node v24.19.0/npm 11.9.0; no pinned install, full governance/runtime test suite, build, dry-run, or actual new trigger dispatch claimed. Inaccessible legacy protection is not certified absent; adoption should confirm no additional non-main requirement. See committed note for full evidence and base cases.\n\nThis change does not affect running pull_request_target workflows until independently approved and merged. Keep this PR Draft; do not merge automatically. Current red tooling gate therefore remains expected.\n\nNo runtime or dependency changes, new phase, real/testnet credentials, exchange access/writes, settings changes, force-push, deployment or merge. No PASS/ACCEPT/merge/live decision.\n\n## Current-SHA corrective verification\nThe first governance self-test (33964968438) completed 78 tests, then correctly rejected stale workflow inventory hashes. Follow-up refreshed only that workflow's blobSha and SHA-256 in trustedGovernanceFiles; all candidate identities, protectedFile rows, rules and other inventory rows compare unchanged. Values independently calculated from actual workflow bytes matched the generator's exact diff. This is an inventory refresh, not a runtime/candidate rebind.\n\nAt de2f5c0fd055e418d0b6d806f994b52baa743544: ordinary CI runs 33965123844 and 33965120390, trusted-governance-self-test 33965123861 (including generator idempotence), and trusted gate 33965121413 all completed successfully. These are CI observations, not approval of the governance change. Main and existing governance/runtime refs remain unchanged; non-main trigger behavior cannot take effect until separately reviewed integration.","created_at":"2026-09-05T12:03:24Z","updated_at":"2026-09-08T04:44:04Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pulls/11/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pulls/11/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/issues/11/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/statuses/de2f5c0fd055e418d0b6d806f994b52baa743544","head":{"label":"danny0971haha:fix/multi-trusted-base-scope-20260905","ref":"fix/multi-trusted-base-scope-20260905","sha":"de2f5c0fd055e418d0b6d806f994b52baa743544","user":{"login":"danny0971haha","id":20290