{"href":"https://github.com/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pull/11"},"issue":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/issues/11"},"comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/issues/11/comments"},"review_comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pulls/11/comments"},"review_comment":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pulls/comments{/number}"},"commits":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pulls/11/commits"},"statuses":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/statuses/de2f5c0fd055e418d0b6d806f994b52baa743544"}},"author_association":"OWNER","auto_merge":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pulls/10","id":4450489234,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUAdvbc8AAAABCUUTkg","html_url":"https://github.com/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pull/10","diff_url":"https://github.com/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pull/10.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pull/10.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/issues/10","number":10,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"style: correct candidate formatting and preserve original evidence","user":{"login":"danny0971haha","id":202909309,"node_id":"U_kgDODBgmfQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/202909309?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha","html_url":"https://github.com/danny0971haha","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Problem and change\nCorrect the six pre-existing format failures, preserving original UTF-8 evidence and hashes in a separate archive. Four JSON values and two TypeScript semantic ASTs remain equal. Trusted workflow correction is separate.\n\n## Identity and scope\nBASE_SHA=a8402fd552d6e2fcf0436d8f2872b7618cb92412\nRESULT_SHA=9c0f63b1ab0e8c58796f63a1e4f86a9cae12d690\nRESULT_TREE=75f5c4b4b5372db0cdf3eb519f910daada7bf61d\nBRANCH=fix/multi-format-evidence-20260905\nPATCH_SHA256=6bfae4ab7e9d7fcfba3441d88d6cc28dad62a71095def2761400e08bca78fc5d\nPATCH_BYTES=62411\nPATCH_LF_COUNT=808\nLOCKFILE_SHA256=a20cb9ac4dffb6cd9f19b594c6e9755dff5067a29bc0391a6ba99a80b5741b51\n\nLocal staged git tree was independently equal to the created remote tree. Publication used GitHub Git Data API; local HEAD still denotes the base, not the remote result. Initial worktree was clean; final local changes are staged. Original PR #9 and frozen/runtime/governance refs remain unchanged.\n\n```text\n docs/FORMAT_CORRECTIVE_20260905.md                 |  59 ++++++\n .../current-candidate/diagnostic-results.json      |  55 ++----\n docs/evidence/current-candidate/results.json       |  60 +-----\n .../current-candidate/simulate-summary.json        |   7 +-\n .../current-candidate/umbrella-summary.json        |   9 +-\n .../format-corrective-20260905/integrity.json      |  38 ++++\n .../format-corrective-20260905/originals.json      |  26 +++\n test/offline-integration/reload-worker.ts          |  43 +++--\n test/offline-integration/scenarios.ts              | 212 +++++++++++++++------\n 9 files changed, 330 insertions(+), 179 deletions(-)\n```\n\n## Validation and limitations\n13 offline integration tests: exit 0, no fail/skip/todo, inherited seccomp isolation. Typecheck: exit 0. Original hashes, JSON equality and TypeScript AST equality verified. git diff --check: exit 0. Local format:check exit 127 (Biome absent); changes follow CI formatter suggestions plus manual formatting. Exact formatter conformance requires new CI.\nLocal tools: Node v24.19.0 / npm 11.9.0 / TypeScript 5.9.3 / tsx 4.23.0; not pinned CI or a clean install. Full pinned historical suites, clean install/build/audit and gate acceptance are not claimed. New CI must be read separately, never inherited.\n\nDetailed scope, evidence and non-claims: docs/FORMAT_CORRECTIVE_20260905.md.\n\n## Boundaries\nSeparate corrective task authorized by the operator's request to implement the shared review findings. No new runtime phase. No exchange credentials/access/writes, testnet, merge, force-push, deployment or repository settings changes. Runtime, lockfiles, candidate bindings and existing safety assertions are preserved. No PASS/ACCEPT/merge/live decision. Draft for independent review only.\n\n## Latest verification (2026-09-05)\nFirst corrective SHA 97d851ae120b4678d479eb9d7202a7333cbdd689 failed format on two remaining line wraps; corrected in the follow-up. Current result 9c0f63b1ab0e8c58796f63a1e4f86a9cae12d690 CI run 33964989187 completed successfully: pinned clean install, typecheck, lint, format, tests, build, secret scan, dry-run, evidence generation/verification/upload. This is CI evidence, not an independent gate decision. The separate pull_request_target gate run 33964990099 still fails because the existing base lacks its classifier; governance PR #11 addresses applicability and remains unmerged.","created_at":"2026-09-05T12:01:03Z","updated_at":"2026-09-05T12:08:27Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[