://github.com/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pull/9.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/issues/9","number":9,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"docs: enable bounded agent autonomy and impact-based reading","user":{"login":"danny0971haha","id":202909309,"node_id":"U_kgDODBgmfQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/202909309?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha","html_url":"https://github.com/danny0971haha","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## 1. Identity\nREPOSITORY=danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine\nIMPLEMENTATION_PHASE=DOCUMENTATION_ONLY_NO_NEW_RUNTIME_PHASE\nCHECKPOINT=AGENT_INSTRUCTION_AUTONOMY\nBRANCH=docs/multi-agent-autonomy-20260905\nBASE_SHA=968ea3b201cd5be58f54df64a02ae29d4ed9ab75\nBASE_TREE=88e3d2d482fd31d7099b15ec4de3a3c6cc2f300e\nRESULT_SHA=a8402fd552d6e2fcf0436d8f2872b7618cb92412\nRESULT_TREE=608a2f82630d258181f65ad97196bf16489832ee\nWORKTREE_CLEAN_BEFORE/AFTER=NOT_OBSERVED_REMOTE_GIT_API_EDIT\n\nThis draft targets the separate tooling branch, not main, frozen Phase 2D, the runtime candidate or trusted governance. It does not rebind or inherit acceptance.\n\n## 2. Toolchain\nRemote GitHub API document edits; no local full repository checkout or pinned runtime environment was established. NODE_VERSION, NPM_VERSION, TYPESCRIPT_VERSION and PACKAGE_MANAGER_VERSION are NOT_RUN for this task, not normalized to the expected pins.\n\n## 3. Scope\nPRIMARY_OBJECTIVE=Complete authorized tasks autonomously without weakening safety or review.\nALLOWED_WRITE_PATHS=AGENTS.md, AI_START_HERE.md, README.md\nFILES_CHANGED=those three files only\nFILES_ADDED=NONE\nFILES_DELETED=NONE\nDIFF_STAT=See this PR's exact current diff\n\nAdd read-only request handling, end-to-end in-scope correction, impact-based reading, evidence-based failure classification, self-review and non-overlapping parallel work. Clarify current task routing and that design requirements do not authorize deferred features.\n\n## 4. Current-byte evidence\nCommitted SHA/tree above and the canonical PR diff are the reviewable evidence. The GitHub commit patch was read back. No claim is made that local git HEAD/worktree equals the remote candidate. Patch byte count/hash and local full-repo git checks were not generated; do not infer them from this summary.\n\n## 5. Dependencies\nNo dependencies, engines, package-manager pins, package scripts, lockfiles or tooling configuration changed.\n\n## 6. Validation commands\n- GitHub commit-diff review: confirms instruction/navigation changes and retained architecture, third-party and safety-semantics sections.\n- Full local clone capability probe failed in this session: git exit 128, github.com DNS unavailable. Connected GitHub reads/writes remained available; Multi was edited through that API, not a fabricated local checkout.\n- INSTALL, TYPECHECK, LINT, FORMAT_CHECK, TEST, BUILD, DRY_RUN, SECRET_SCAN and full-repository DIFF_CHECK: NOT_RUN in this documentation task; no successful exits or test totals are asserted.\n- Existing base CI format failures in newly added integration/evidence files are deliberately not corrected or reclassified by this instruction-only patch. CI on this new SHA must be assessed separately.\n\n## 7. Contract conformance\nRead AGENTS.md, AI_START_HERE.md, README.md, CURRENT_STATUS.md, REVIEW_CHANGE_PROTOCOL.md and EVIDENCE_TEMPLATE.md at the pinned baseline, including prior connected reads in this task context.\nCONTRACT_FILES_CHANGED=AGENTS.md behavioral instructions, explicitly requested by the operator\nEXPERIMENT_ENVELOPE_CHANGED=NO\nARCHITECTURE_SEMANTICS_CHANGED=NO\nSafety/runtime/phase/review contracts and precedence remain unchanged. The earlier mandatory full reading list is replaced with common entry reads plus relevant contracts; any explicit task/gate required reading remains mandatory.\n\n## 8. Safety claims and evidence\nRuntime safety claims are NOT_REVALIDATED_THIS_TASK. Original Mandatory architecture, Third-party boundary and every existing Required v0.1 safety-semantics bullet remain present; the added text explicitly separates requirements from implemented capabilities. No source, runtime, storage/lease/halt/ACK, process-fence or trading configuration changed.\n\n## 9–13. Runtime/fault/artifact evidence\nNo fault matrix, process-crash run, durable-state artifact, venue audit or telemetry run was performed or generated by this documentation checkpoint. Historical tests, exact totals, schemas, fixtures, evidence files and raw logs are unchanged. No runtime claim is inferred from documentation review.\n\n## 14. CI evidence\nAny current-SHA push/PR CI is external to this document edit and must be read separately. Prior-SHA CI does not validate this candidate. No CI PASS is declared here.\n\n## 15. Unresolved risks\nLocal full-repository validation was unavailable. Existing formatting and broader candidate verification blockers remain outside scope. Applying new instructions requires using this branch or a separately reviewed integration; main/frozen branches do not automatically receive them. Self-review/subagents are not an independent gate.\n\n## 16. Prohibited-action attestation\nLIVE_EXCHANGE_WRITE=NO\nTESTNET_WRITE=NO\nPRODUCTION_API_KEY_USED=NO\nTESTNET_TRADING_KEY_USED=NO\nWITHDRAWAL_PERMISSION_USED=NO\nTHIRD_PARTY_SOURCE_COPIED=NO\nMAIN_FORCE_PUSHED=NO\nFORCE_PUSH=NO\nMERGE_EXECUTED=NO\nREPOSITORY_SETTINGS_CHANGED=NO\nPRODUCTION_DEPLOYMENT=NO\nNEXT_PHASE_STARTED=NO\n\n## 17–18. Requested independent review\nRequest documentation/instruction review only, bound to the base/result above. No runtime gate PASS, ACCEPT, merge, deployment or live authority is declared or requested. Preserve frozen Phase 2D `7f196d367e39640eee9517f742b0d61424f9d4cc`, runtime `704afa2dd858c52dad06aa22941d463aa5ce4d69`, and governance `52445f4c2b3eb65f13ae00dbef80f07b417a7d53`.","created_at":"2026-09-05T06:34:46Z","updated_at":"2026-09-05T06:36:17Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pulls/9/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pulls/9/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/issues/9/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/statuses/a8402fd552d6e2fcf0436d8f2872b7618cb92412","head":{"label":"danny0971haha:docs/multi-agent-autonomy-20260905","ref":"docs/multi-agent-autonomy-20260905","sha":"a8402fd552d6e2fcf0436d8f2872b7618cb92412","user":{"login":"danny0971haha","id":202909309,"node_id":"U_kgDODBgmfQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/202909309?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha","html_url":"https://github.com/danny0971haha","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api