id-engine/issues/8/comments"},"review_comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pulls/8/comments"},"review_comment":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pulls/comments{/number}"},"commits":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pulls/8/commits"},"statuses":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/statuses/52445f4c2b3eb65f13ae00dbef80f07b417a7d53"}},"author_association":"OWNER","auto_merge":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pulls/7","id":4370551460,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUAdvbc8AAAABBIFSpA","html_url":"https://github.com/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pull/7","diff_url":"https://github.com/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pull/7.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pull/7.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/issues/7","number":7,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Phase 2E: durable halt, kill-switch, and acknowledgement","user":{"login":"danny0971haha","id":202909309,"node_id":"U_kgDODBgmfQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/202909309?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha","html_url":"https://github.com/danny0971haha","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\n- Stacked Phase 2E candidate only: durable halt state machine, unique `haltId`, kill-switch remediation, and durable-authoritative acknowledgement on top of frozen Phase 2 (`7f196d367e39640eee9517f742b0d61424f9d4cc`).\n- Uses the existing exact-pair store, persistence latch, and runtime lease. Halt IDs come from an injected source in tests; callers cannot supply create-authority or ACK durable state.\n- Does not start Phase 2F, does not declare `GATE_2=PASS` or `PHASE_2E=PASS`, and does not authorize live trading.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `npm test` remains 474/474 (Phase 2E is a separate `npm run test:phase2e` script so Phase 2D Corrective 4 evidence identity is unchanged)\n- [x] `npm run test:phase2e` 24/24 including P2-H01–H13\n- [x] Parent-delivered SIGKILL crash matrix: halt 32/32, ACK 16/16, fresh-process reload\n- [x] `npm run dry-run` reports `liveExchangeWrites=false`\n- [ ] Independent reviewer decides Phase 2E; CI on this stacked branch is expected to fail Phase 2D evidence verify because that verifier is bound to `experiment/v0.1-phase2`\n\n## Boundary\n\n```text\nBASE=experiment/v0.1-phase2\nHEAD=experiment/v0.1-phase2e-halt-ack\nLIVE_TRADING_AUTHORIZED=NO\nPHASE_2F=NOT_STARTED\nGATE_2=NOT_DECLARED\nSELF_DECLARED_PASS=NO\n```\n\n\nMade with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)","created_at":"2026-08-26T20:32:26Z","updated_at":"2026-08-31T09:51:05Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pulls/7/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pulls/7/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pulls/comments{