s.githubusercontent.com/u/202909309?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha","html_url":"https://github.com/danny0971haha","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Status\n\n```text\nCURRENT_SOURCE_HEAD=7f196d367e39640eee9517f742b0d61424f9d4cc\nCORRECTIVE_4_IMPLEMENTATION_BASE=c64fa291af0d53139c6c526cd25ede434c08c17b\nINDEPENDENT_REVIEW_GATE_0=PASS\nINDEPENDENT_REVIEW_GATE_1=PASS\nPHASE_2A=PASS\nPHASE_2B=PASS\nACCEPTED_PHASE_1_HEAD=057732cee021889d17573425ee4f24e2065df1e9\nACCEPTED_PHASE_2A_HEAD=51400c0f5a43c96f691115383e565743f543c9ee\nACCEPTED_PHASE_2B_HEAD=41eb277a7d6dfe36dbb864bc8190d5a20663dc4a\nCUMULATIVE_PHASE_2_BASELINE=PASS\nINTEGRATION_MERGE_HEAD=5b0fd685586ec57b110159ccc36e5b21ba23ac28\nINTEGRATION_MERGE_TREE=420c4184209a0c919829e5fc1b66b653d37b8460\nPHASE1_IS_ANCESTOR_OF_INTEGRATION=YES\nPHASE_2C=REJECT\nPHASE_2C_CORRECTIVE_1=REJECT\nPHASE_2C_CORRECTIVE_2=PASS\nPHASE_2C_SELF_DECLARED_PASS=NO\nPHASE_2D=REJECT\nPHASE_2D_CORRECTIVE_1=REJECT\nPHASE_2D_CORRECTIVE_2=ACCEPT\nPHASE_2D_CORRECTIVE_3=REJECT\nPHASE_2D_CORRECTIVE_4_IMPLEMENTATION=ACCEPT\nPHASE_2D_CORRECTIVE_4_EVIDENCE_CORRECTIVE_1=ACCEPT_AT_EXACT_HEAD\nPHASE_2D_OVERALL=NOT_CLOSED\nPHASE_2D_SELF_DECLARED_PASS=NO\nindependentReview=NOT_PERFORMED\ngateStatus=NOT_EMITTED\nPHASE_2E_AUTHORIZED=NO\nPHASE_2E_STARTED=NO\nGATE_2=NOT_REVIEWED\nSYSTEM_ALLOW_RISK_INCREASE=false\nLIVE_EXCHANGE_WRITE_AUTHORIZED=NO\nMERGE_AUTHORIZED=NO\nDEPLOYMENT_AUTHORIZED=NO\nFORCE_PUSH_AUTHORIZED=NO\n```\n\nThis remains a Draft. The implementation agent, evidence generator, and evidence verifier do **not** declare `PHASE_2D=PASS`, `GATE_2=PASS`, merge, or live authorization. Independent-review ACCEPT values above are reviewer/architect ledger for this exact HEAD; they are not CI output and must not be regenerated by the candidate scripts.\n\nTrusted review boundary (cannot be rewritten by this branch): Draft PR https://github.com/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pull/4\n\n## Current candidate identity (exact)\n\n```text\nSOURCE_HEAD=7f196d367e39640eee9517f742b0d61424f9d4cc\nEVIDENCE_SCHEMA=multi-venue-phase2d-corrective4/2\nVERIFIER_SCHEMA=multi-venue-phase2d-corrective4-verifier/2\nFULL_TESTS=474/474\nFAIL=0\nSKIP=0\nTODO=0\nCANCELLED=0\nCORRECTIVE_4_TESTS=15/15\nEVIDENCE_VERIFIER_TESTS=46/46\nAUDIT_VULNERABILITIES=0\nLATEST_CI_RUN=32854917675\nLATEST_CI_JOB=97824428764\nLATEST_CI_URL=https://github.com/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/actions/runs/32854917675\n```\n\nRisk implementation bytes remain frozen at `c64fa291af0d53139c6c526cd25ede434c08c17b`. This branch must not move to manufacture new evidence.\n\n## CI identity (exact, not prose)\n\nGitHub Action **dependencies** are pinned by immutable commit SHA:\n\n- `actions/checkout@3d3c42e5aac5ba805825da76410c181273ba90b1` (v7.0.1)\n- `actions/setup-node@820762786026740c76f36085b0efc47a31fe5020` (v7.0.0)\n- `actions/upload-artifact@043fb46d1a93c77aae656e7c1c64a875d1fc6a0a` (v7.0.1)\n\n`persist-credentials: false`. Ordinary CI `permissions: contents: read`.\n\nThe **tested checkout** follows the GitHub event checkout. It is not rewritten to a floating tag.\n\n**Source HEAD** and the pull_request merge checkout are recorded separately:\n\n- `pull_request`: `sourceHeadSha` = `github.event.pull_request.head.sha`; tested checkout = event merge checkout (`github.sha`)\n- `push`: source HEAD and tested checkout may be the same commit\n\nGenerator: `npm run evidence:phase2d-corrective4`.\nIndependent verifier: `npm run evidence:phase2d-corrective4:verify`.\nThe generator does not write reviewer ACCEPT / PASS. The verifier writes `gateStatus=NOT_EMITTED` and does not emit a gate decision.\n\n## Phase 2D Corrective 4 (frozen implementation)\n\nObject/raw UTF-8 budget parity and ambiguous JSON fail-closed, frozen at `CORRECTIVE_4_IMPLEMENTATION_BASE`.\n\n- Shared 65,536 UTF-8 byte budget on object and raw-byte APIs\n- Duplicate JSON keys fail closed as `INVALID_RISK_INPUT` before math\n- Unpaired JS surrogates fail closed before parse\n- Focused suite remains **15 tests / 15 pass**\n- Frozen 100U / 5x / 30U / 150U / -5U / 10U limits unchanged\n\nEvidence: `docs/PHASE_2D_CORRECTIVE_4_EVIDENCE.md`.\n\n## Phase 2D Corrective 3 (historical only)\n\nIndependent reviewer disposition: **REJECT**. Historical candidate, not current:\n\n```text\nHISTORICAL_CORRECTIVE_3_CANDIDATE_HEAD=4af26dac5f2e50b335e998e925e0a1d97b4164b4\nHISTORICAL_CORRECTIVE_3_CANDIDATE_TREE=a46a3d8a72dfda6bb5f3a16b7b649ed0d08e0e93\nHISTORICAL_CORRECTIVE_3_TEST_TOTAL=413\nHISTORICAL_CORRECTIVE_3_PUSH_CI=32793357561\nHISTORICAL_CORRECTIVE_3_PR_CI=32793360611\n```\n\n## Phase 2D Corrective 2\n\nIndependent reviewer disposition: **ACCEPT**. Runtime input fail-closed boundary for `evaluateRisk(input: unknown)` remains in place under the object API.\n\n## Independent reviewer checklist (do not skip)\n\nA. Phase 2C Corrective 2 (accepted)\n- empty/in-progress coordination lock recovery\n- orphaned recover claim\n- no two valid guards\n- replaced file identity\n- callbackCount=0\n- host-local-only limitation is not distributed fencing\n\nB. Phase 2D Corrective 1 (rejected; do not re-open as PASS)\n- full proposed batch exposure\n- invalid grid / discriminant HALT\n\nC. Phase 2D Corrective 2 (accepted)\n- `evaluateRisk` does not throw on null/undefined/primitives\n- missing or non-array collections HALT without `.map`\n- throwing getters and Proxy traps do not escape\n- `systemAllowRiskIncrease=false`\n\nD. Phase 2D Corrective 3 (rejected; historical `4af26dac` only)\n- object/raw UTF-8 budget mismatch was the reject reason\n- do not treat 413-test / Corrective 3 run IDs as the current candidate\n\nE. Phase 2D Corrective 4 implementation (frozen at `c64fa291`)\n- object and raw APIs share the 65,536 UTF-8 budget\n- exact 65,536 admits; 65,537 HALT with `RISK_INPUT_LIMIT_EXCEEDED`\n- duplicate keys fail closed before math\n- unpaired JS surrogates fail closed before parse\n- focused suite 15/15\n- `systemAllowRiskIncrease=false`\n\nF. Evidence corrective 1 (exact HEAD `7f196d367e39640eee9517f742b0d61424f9d4cc`)\n- schema `multi-venue-phase2d-corrective4/2` and verifier schema `multi-venue-phase2d-corrective4-verifier/2`\n- independent verifier does not trust generator verdicts\n- tamper of SHA, hashes, TAP totals, audit JSON, or gate verdict fails closed\n- source HEAD is not impersonated by the GitHub merge checkout\n- generator/verifier must not write reviewer ACCEPT\n- independent review results belong in an independent reviewer record\n\nG. Trusted review boundary (separate Draft PR #4; not this branch)\n- freeze job must not checkout or execute this PR\n- protected risk bytes must remain identical to `c64fa291`\n- a new source HEAD fails closed until the baseline on `main` is updated\n\n## Explicit non-claims\n\n```text\nPHASE_2D_SELF_DECLARED_PASS=NO\nPHASE_2D_OVERALL=NOT_CLOSED\nindependentReview=NOT_PERFORMED\ngateStatus=NOT_EMITTED\nPHASE_2E_AUTHORIZED=NO\nPHASE_2E_STARTED=NO\nGATE_2=NOT_REVIEWED\nSYSTEM_ALLOW_RISK_INCREASE=false\nLIVE_EXCHANGE_WRITE=NO\nMERGE_AUTHORIZED=NO\nDEPLOYMENT_AUTHORIZED=NO\n```","created_at":"2026-08-23T11:28:11Z","updated_at":"2026-08-27T05:26:46Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[]